OL,3,GNEWSALabour take seat from Reform UK in
OL,4,Aby-election win
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour has narrowly won a
OL,7,FLeicestershire County Council
OL,8,Fby-election, taking a seat from Reform
OL,9,FUK.
OL,11,FVoters went to the polls on Thursday to
OL,12,Felect a new councillor for the Shepshed
OL,13,Fdivision.
OL,15,FLabour candidate Jane Lennie secured
OL,16,F1,163 votes, beating Reform's Stuart
OL,17,FWood by 53.
OL,19,FThe result was confirmed after a
OL,20,Frecount, requested by Reform, because
OL,21,Fof the narrow margin.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
